  "citations": [],
  "notes": "A sale whose transaction is also recorded on the other term's covered-st family is recorded twice. A sale flagged ordinary_indicated, box_1f_market_discount, qof_indicated, collectibles_or_special_rate yes is outside the eligible-sale predicate. A sale flagged taxpayer_side_adjustment yes needs an adjustment this return does not compute. v2: a sale whose long_term flag names the other term, a line 1a or 8a sale with box 1g checked, and a sale whose own proceeds, basis or wash-sale row differs from the sale are refused."
